   "heading": {
    "en": "Compoundable offences"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The following offences may be compounded by the Director-General in accordance with section 69 of the Act:\n(a)any offence under sections 7(2), 8(3), 10(4), 11(4), 12(3), 13(3), 14(2), 16(3), 17(4), 19(4), 22(3), 23(2), 24(2), 25(5), 26(3), 27(2), 28(2), 29(2), 30(5) and (6), 32(2), 33(2), 34(2), 35(6), 37(7) and (8), 38(6), 39(3), 40(10) and (11), 41C(2), 42(1), 43(3), 43A(2), 43B(3) and (4), 48(2), 49(3), 52A(7), 61, 56(4), 54(2), 53(2) and 55(2) of the Act; and\n[S 13/2015 wef 16/01/2015]\n(b)any offence under any rule made under the Act."
   }
